{"id":"36e399406195f579","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-model5-expansion.md","title":"ZFC Model5 Expansion","display":"df-zfc-model5-expansion — ZFC Model5 Expansion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model5-expansion","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model5-expansion"],"display":"df-zfc-model5-expansion — ZFC Model5 Expansion","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-interpretation.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model5-expansion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model5-expansion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model5-expansion — ZFC Model5 Expansion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"183594346c3dc6c2\" href=\"?note=183594346c3dc6c2\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-interpretation.md\">../batch05/58-df-interpretation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_0,L_1,M,N\\in V\">\\(L_0,L_1,M,N\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_i.\\mathrm{Cst},L_i.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L_i.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\">\\(L_i.\\mathrm{Cst},L_i.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L_i.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\)</span> (signature components)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^M_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^M_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^M_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\">\\(I^M_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^M_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^M_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\\)</span> and the corresponding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>-interpretations</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Expansion}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Expansion}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}expansion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Expansion}_S(L_0,L_1,N,M)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L_0)\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L_0)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,L_1)\n\\land L_0.\\mathrm{Cst}\\subseteq L_1.\\mathrm{Cst}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\nL_0.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\subseteq L_1.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\n\\land L_0.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\subseteq L_1.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(N)=\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\n\\land\\forall c\\in L_0.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;\nI^N_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)=I^M_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall s\\in L_0.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\nI^N_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(s)=I^M_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(s)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in L_0.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;\nI^N_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)=I^M_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}expansion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Expansion}_S(L_0,L_1,N,M)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L_0)\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L_0)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,L_1)\n\\land L_0.\\mathrm{Cst}\\subseteq L_1.\\mathrm{Cst}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\nL_0.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\subseteq L_1.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\n\\land L_0.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\subseteq L_1.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(N)=\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\n\\land\\forall c\\in L_0.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;\nI^N_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)=I^M_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall s\\in L_0.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\nI^N_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(s)=I^M_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(s)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in L_0.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;\nI^N_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)=I^M_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC model-theoretic definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-interpretation.md","status":"resolved","id":"183594346c3dc6c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-interpretation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2$ and $\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L_0,L_1,M,N\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"L_i.\\mathrm{Cst},L_i.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L_i.\\mathrm{Rel}_n","display":false},{"tex":"I^M_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^M_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^M_{\\mathrm{rel},n}","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Expansion}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}expansion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Expansion}_S(L_0,L_1,N,M)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L_0)\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L_0)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,L_1)\n\\land L_0.\\mathrm{Cst}\\subseteq L_1.\\mathrm{Cst}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\nL_0.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\subseteq L_1.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\n\\land L_0.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\subseteq L_1.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(N)=\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\n\\land\\forall c\\in L_0.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;\nI^N_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)=I^M_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall s\\in L_0.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\nI^N_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(s)=I^M_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(s)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in L_0.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;\nI^N_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)=I^M_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1832,"backlinks":[{"id":"adb12f159542bc6f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Expansion}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-model5-expansion.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2753","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-model5-expansion.md|58-df-zfc-model5-expansion]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","3888033a846b1cd5","183594346c3dc6c2","d9b8711cda3f31ca"]}